# Macabre Reconstruction: the discount needs a creature card put into your graveyard *this turn* (CR 601.2f, 118.7). Bot1 discards a Memnite to Faithless Looting on turn 1; on turn 3 it is no longer "this turn", so
# the spell costs the full {3}{B}: two Mox Jets are not enough (refused), and with a Mox Ruby and an Island as well it is cast, targeting just the Memnite ("up to two" allows one target, CR 115.1).

